{:brand {:name "gftd"
         :short-name "gftd"}
 :identity
 {:account-domain "gftd.ai"
  :organization-domain-suffix "gftd.ai"
  ;; The corporate tenant used to be handed its apex domain here, as
  ;; `:organization-domain-overrides {"gftd" "gftd.ai"}`. ADR-0043 removed that
  ;; key: it was this file asserting a name, and `docs/tenant-model.md` says in
  ;; the same breath that configuration does not prove ownership.
  ;;
  ;; To get `gftd.ai` back as the tenant's name, the owner proves it — publish
  ;; the TXT record the settings card issues under a zone this operator already
  ;; holds, point the name at this deployment, then activate. Until then the
  ;; tenant reads as `gftd.gftd.ai`, which is what it has always resolved to.
  ;; Managed user organizations are unchanged at {organization-id}.gftd.ai.
  ;;
  ;; Set true in the private production override only after the matching
  ;; did.json documents are live and continuously monitored.
  :publish-did-web? false}
 :cloud-relay
 {:base-url "https://relay.gftd.ai"
  :access-token-env "GFTD_CLOUD_ACCESS_TOKEN"}}
